WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.446
Go to the Lungfish Genome Explorer website and click the current stable release.

00:00:09.446 --> 00:00:12.179
If Safari asks, allow the download.

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:15.614
It runs on Apple Silicon Macs with macOS 26.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.438
Open the downloaded file.

00:00:18.438 --> 00:00:23.344
In the window that appears, drag Lungfish onto the Applications folder.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:27.643
Open Lungfish from your Applications folder.

00:00:27.643 --> 00:00:32.110
If macOS asks whether to open an app from the internet, click Open.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.055
The Welcome window opens.

00:00:35.055 --> 00:00:37.934
Under Third-Party Tools, click Install.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:41.107
LGE downloads the programs it runs for you.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.207
It takes a while, and you only do it once.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:48.699
Click Create Project, type a name, and click Save.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.930
A project is one folder on your Mac.

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:00.157
It holds your data and your results as you work.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.769
Next, open a demo project with real data and look around the window.
